         ,THE FLAG OF ,PAKISTAN

  ,LIKE EVERY COUNTRY'S FLAG1 THE FLAG
OF ,PAKISTAN IS ITS IDENTITY4 ,IT HAS
THE COLOURS GREEN AND WHITE4
  ,IN THE FLAG1 THE GREEN COLOUR STANDS
FOR ,MUSLIMS AND THE WHITE COLOUR STANDS
FOR PEOPLE OF OTHER RELIGIONS4 ,THE
CRESCENT MOON ON IT IS A SYMBOL OF
PROGRESS1 AND THE STAR IS A SYMBOL OF
LIGHT AND KNOWLEDGE4
  ,PICTURE3 ,THE FLAG OF ,PAKISTAN3
THERE IS A WHITE STRIPE ON THE LEFT1 AND
THE BIGGER PART IS GREEN WITH A WHITE
CRESCENT MOON AND A WHITE FIVE-POINTED
STAR IN THE MIDDLE4
  ,DO YOU KNOW8 ,A LARGE PIECE OR AREA
OF DRY LAND ON ,EARTH IS CALLED A
CONTINENT4 ,THERE ARE SEVEN CONTINENTS
IN THE WORLD4

             ,HELPFUL HINTS

,FOR EVERYONE3 ,A WAY TO REMEMBER THE
  FLAG3 THE BIG PART IS GREEN1 THE SMALL
  STRIPE IS WHITE1 AND THERE IS A MOON
  AND A STAR IN THE MIDDLE4 ,THINK3
  WHERE HAVE YOU SEEN THE FLAG FLYING8
  ,FOR EXAMPLE1 AT SCHOOL OR ON #AD
  ,AUGUST4
,VISION3 ,LISTEN TO THE DESCRIPTION OF
  THE FLAG4 ,HOLD A CLOTH OR PAPER FLAG
  AND FEEL IT2 AN ADULT CAN PUT GLUE OR
  THREAD ON THE MOON AND STAR TO MAKE
  THEM RAISED4
,MOVEMENT3 ,YOU DO NOT HAVE TO WRITE IN
  THE MAP ACTIVITY4 ,YOU CAN SAY THE
  NAMES ALOUD OR TOUCH THE RIGHT NAME ON
  THE SCREEN4
,FOR TEACHERS3 ,POINT TO THE PARTS OF
